@startuml UML_P3_Ranked_Match_StateMachine

title State Machine - Ranked Match

[*] --> Queuing : User join queue

Queuing : Đang tìm đối thủ
Queuing --> Matched : Tìm thấy
Queuing --> [*] : Timeout 5p

Matched : 2 players ready
Matched --> Playing : Start game

Playing : Game đang diễn ra
Playing : Clock chạy
Playing --> Finished : Checkmate/Draw
Playing --> Forfeited : AFK/Disconnect

Forfeited : Vi phạm luật
Forfeited --> Finished : Apply penalty

Finished : Game kết thúc
Finished : Update Elo
Finished --> [*]

note right of Queuing
  Tìm opponent
  rating ±100 Elo
end note

note right of Playing
  Clock: 10 phút/người
  Inactivity: 2 phút
end note

note right of Forfeited
  AFK >2 phút → Thua
  Disconnect >30s → Thua
  Chưa đi + <1 phút → Hủy
end note

@enduml
